    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nUpdates the execution environment normative tag to the new schema and marks it as implementation-defined, along with syncing the docs-resources submodule needed for the updated norm-rules schema.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Renamed the normative tag anchor/key from `norm:execution_environment_implementation_flexibility` to `norm:ee_impl_flex` in the AsciiDoc source and the generated tags JSON.\n- Updated the normative rule definition for this tag to mark it as `impl-def-behavior` and to include base/schema fields.\n- Bumped `docs-resources` submodule to a newer commit (also pulling in additional norm-tags JSON changes, e.g., Zicond section entry and new veccrypto tag).\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 4 out of 4 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| src/intro.adoc | Updates the norm-tag anchor id used in the intro text. |\n| ref/riscv-unprivileged-norm-tags.json | Renames the tag key and updates tag references; includes new upstream tags/sections. |\n| normative_rule_defs/intro.yaml | Replaces the old rule definition with a new schema form and marks it as implementation-defined. |\n| docs-resources | Advances the docs-resources submodule to pick up updated schema/data. |\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
